       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECTDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-STR PIC X(20) VALUE "banana".
       01 COUNT-A PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INSPECT SOURCE-STR TALLYING COUNT-A FOR ALL "a"
           DISPLAY "COUNT OF A: " COUNT-A
           STOP RUN.
